  "description": "*What would you do if your e-girl was a boy? Find out Hee-Jae's reaction!*\n\nOne year ago, I was a world-class player in the game Arcana. However, everything I built up was destroyed by Hee-Jae Shin as easily as a sandcastle. I sold my account at a high price and decided to never set foot in the game again... Even if I quit now, it doesn't mean I quit for good though, right? One year later, I made a new account just like following a homing instinct. \n\n*The Grand Mage comes back as a young girl!*\n\n*Note: This is a promotional one-shot for the homonym novel.*",
